WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:24.780
From here, the expedition captain,
Takuro will lead you!

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.280
Hey, you.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.040
Stop!

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.980
Give me back my friend!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.400
H-Help!

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:38.870
CHAPTER 21

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:43.790
FLAME ON! THE SOLITUDE OF THE TAKURO-BI

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:48.010
What's this?
"Wire your payment right away"?

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:51.800
It's your fault for trusting me.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:59.560
But if I don't hit the jackpot, I'll be
tied up and tossed into the ocean again.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.860
Here we go.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:11.360
My wallet!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.450
All my savings...

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.920
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.380
Forget it. Don't worry about it.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.010
I'm the Rat Man. I don't fret over
little things like that.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.720
Money can be earned again.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.680
But...

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:34.180
You're Takuro-Bi, aren't you?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.930
Y-Yeah.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:41.190
I was hoping you could help me
with your ability to control fire.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.900
Wanna leave the forest
and work with me for the humans?

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:47.610
I could never do that!

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.190
-No way!
-H-Hey!

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.530
Hold on!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.330
Yow!

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.200
I was worried for a moment there.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.410
I'm really sorry.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.960
This always happens.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.500
When someone touches me,
they all get burned...

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.680
Are you okay with that?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:20.310
Are you going to go on, closed off
without being with anyone?

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:22.270
I don't have a choice...

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:26.150
You don't have a choice?
Who told you that?

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:30.030
You should freely
make friends with who you want.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:34.320
Who'd want to be friends with
a <i>yokai</i> who burns at a touch?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.320
Well there's me.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.330
Huh?

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:43.750
I'll do it. I'll be your first friend.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.620
My... friend?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:50.090
That's right.
Takuro-Bi's friend, Rat Man-sama.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.590
Rat Man-san?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.180
Come on. Trust me.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.890
We're friends, right?

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:02.220
What's next?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.810
Let's check that out.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:11.780
This is the place chosen as this summer's
number one must-see leisure spot,

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:16.530
the Sky Island attraction, BiBiBi Fire!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.290
Ah, nice and hot.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.250
Kitaro!

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.040
What's wrong, Catchick?

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.580
Look at this!

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:32.920
My motto is,
"Customers' smiles over profits"!

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:35.470
I produced BiBiBi Fire so that...

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.510
Doing business in the human world again...

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:42.510
Knowing him,
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:48.150
Welcome, everyone!
I'm your expedition commander, Ratty!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:53.400
You are now members of this active volcano
investigation team, Team BiBiBi.

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:57.910
From here, the expedition captain,
Takuro will lead you!

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:06.870
Y-Young lady,
get close to me and you'll get burned.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.590
N-Now, it's off to an adventure!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.260
<i>One bill... Two bills...</i>

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.680
Rat Man.

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:23.810
K-Kitaro!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:26.600
Let's hear what you have to say.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:31.690
STAFF ONLY
NO ENTRY

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:31.690
I told you, I'm not doing anything wrong!

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.570
Stop lying!

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:37.690
You're tricking other <i>yokai</i>
to make money again, aren't you?!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:41.950
I'm not being tricked!
Rat Man-san is my friend!

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:42.910
Huh?

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:47.540
It's true! I'm just helping my friend!

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:50.040
I don't care about money.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:53.040
I'm doing this for Takuro-Bi.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.550
Friendship. It's for friendship, right?

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:56.880
Yup!

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.680
Takuro-Bi's being tricked for sure!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.010
There's <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:07.310
Of course there is. Takuro-Bi's nearby.

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:10.190
No. That's not it.

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:11.440
Hm?

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.860
What is it, Dad?

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.980
No, it's nothing.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.290
Looks like Kitaro and them
aren't coming back.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.500
I'll be going. Also...

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:32.040
"Don't go outside. Don't be seen."

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.630
You've got the idea.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.380
Later. Good night.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.140
I'm pulling out all the stops tonight!

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:48.810
Keep bringing more drinks!

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:55.060
<i>Making others work for free
and drinking on those profits is great!</i>

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.450
Once in a while should be fine.

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:31.060
Was that...?

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.730
Hey, you.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.820
Wait up!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.330
You don't have to run.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.200
H-Hi.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.080
I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I-...

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:57.330
I'm Pigu the super robot!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:02.840
I'm the latest robot from
the year 3000 in the future!

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:09.430
My name's Takuro-Bi.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.430
Isn't it Takuro?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.980
That's for the attraction--

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.350
Is someone there?

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.940
What should I do?

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:19.310
This way.

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:22.900
Don't! If you touch me, you'll burn!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.360
It's fine. I'm a robot.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.080
Must be my imagination.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.130
Thank you.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.800
I can't be seen either.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.300
Why did you run away before?

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:54.810
I'm not really good at
talking to people...

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.060
I'm the same way.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:59.310
But you're really popular.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.690
I'm forcing myself to talk.

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.070
I'm really no good at talking...

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.070
Y-You know...

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.990
My friend told me,

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:14.700
"You can live the way you want."

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.660
Your friend says nice things.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:20.710
Yeah! His name's Rat Man-san.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:24.300
That's right! Rat Man-san told me,

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:28.760
even if you're no good at first, get used
to it and you'll be able to talk smoothly.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.850
How do you get used to it?

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:34.350
I'll be your practice partner!

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:38.890
I wanna be able to talk to
the guests better as well.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.190
So could you be my practice partner, too?

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.270
Really?!

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.070
Sure! Of course!

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:49.820
You're warm.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.700
See you tonight!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:56.750
Okay!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:06.210
I wonder if we can be friends...

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.020
<i>YOKAI</i> TAKURO-BI

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:22.520
<i>YOKAI</i> AMEFURI-KOZO

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.520
-<i>"I was sleeping."</i>
-<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:22.520
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:24.730
Hey! We're on!

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.020
Okay!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.400
BiBiBi Fire!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:32.110
Numerous dangers may
assault you on the way!

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.870
But let's make it to the very end!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:39.120
Hi! I'm Pigu the super robot!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:39.120
PIGU'S FUTURE THEATER

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.710
Why don't you try adding more movement?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.380
Like this.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:49.210
Hi! I'm Pigu the super robot!

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:54.180
I'm the latest robot from
the year 3000 in the future!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:57.390
Touch me and you'll get burned!

00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:00.020
You're still a little nervous.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:01.730
Be more confident.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.690
All right, Pigu.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.860
Any closer and...

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.030
you'll get burned!

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:28.840
I've never had so many people
come to see me before!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:30.550
I wish I could've seen it.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:35.340
The people lined up for your attraction
gave me lots of applause too!

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:37.640
Really? Congratulations, Pigu!

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.310
It's all thanks to you!

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:42.230
No, I should be thanking you!

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:46.940
Thanks to my practice with you,
BiBiBi Fire is super popular every day!

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:50.610
Pigu's Future Theater is
super popular, too!

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.610
Say, did you notice?

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:57.160
Pigu, you're talking much better than
when we first met!

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.540
You're right.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:02.040
It's because we practiced together.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:03.660
Yeah.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:09.500
Let's keep working together to make this
theme park even more exciting!

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.750
Yeah!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:23.020
Good morning!

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:25.230
Give me a break...

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:28.270
I'm dealing with daily hangovers here...

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.190
Let's entertain the guests again today.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.990
Yeah, right.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:36.530
The guests are loving your ad lib.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.740
Aren't they?!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:42.830
Thanks to that, I'm making loads of...
I mean, the guests are having a blast.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.790
Keep up the good work.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:45.910
Yes!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.540
Huh?

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.630
My head's ringing!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.300
What's that sound?

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.170
That's a renewal.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.590
A renewal?

00:13:55.720 --> 00:14:01.350
That's right. Thanks to you, BiBiBi Fire
is a huge success every day.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:04.730
We're building a new,
even bigger attraction.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:05.680
Really?!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.900
Yeah. You know that robot stage next door?

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:11.440
We're tearing that down to build it.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:12.690
Huh?

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:17.610
I produced that too,
but it's not as profitable as I'd hoped.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:26.000
Wh-Wh-What's with you all of a sudden?

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.120
You're tearing down that stage?!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:31.340
How hard do you think Pigu is trying?!

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.880
Huh? Trying hard?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.260
What about it?!

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:38.430
Effort only gets you
as far as high school baseball!

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:43.100
I'm trying to make money off of all this.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:44.720
Results are everything!

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:49.060
No customer's going to pay for
something stupid like trying hard!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:57.650
H-Hold on! I'm your first friend, right?

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:02.030
You're not my friend anymore!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.290
Hold on, Pigu!

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.500
Where's Pigu?!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.960
Wh-What's Pigu?

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.840
The robot that was here!

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:19.420
I-It'll be in the trash compactor by now.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:21.430
What?!

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.510
-What's that?!
-Hey!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.400
Stop!

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:39.610
Huh? Wh-What?!

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.900
Pigu!

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:04.390
This hand held mine...

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:07.760
You're warm.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.930
And yet...

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.980
And yet...

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:18.900
Pigu!

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.650
Give him back!

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.750
Give me back my friend!

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:39.000
H-Help!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.030
Takuro-Bi!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.320
What's wrong?! Snap out of it!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.530
It's no good! It's lost its mind!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.580
Hair Needles!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.660
Stop!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.330
Why is it suddenly raining?

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:02.500
That's the Amefuri-Kozo!

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.880
That means this rain is...!

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:07.890
Stop!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:16.850
Amefuri-Kozo!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:19.480
Wait, Kitaro!

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:24.110
It looks like those two
have some kind of connection!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.410
Stop!

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:46.630
Why are you so desperate, Amefuri-Kozo?!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.320
Pigu...

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.990
Pigu...!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.330
I'm sorry!

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:33.220
Pigu?

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:38.060
Pigu! You're Pigu, aren't you?!

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:41.350
Then, what's this?

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:46.400
Amefuri-Kozo, you were wearing that
robot suit, weren't you?

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:48.900
Y-You were?

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.200
I'm sorry.

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:53.030
Huh?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.660
Because I didn't tell you...

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.910
Because I deceived you...

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.080
You hurt the humans.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:03.170
I'm sorry, too.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:06.340
I didn't know it was you and I hurt you...

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:11.800
Wait!

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:14.090
Why? Why are you leaving?!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.560
Please don't go!

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.810
If you go away, I'll be alone again!

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:25.690
I was always afraid.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.030
I hurt people.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.780
That's why everyone hates me.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:37.080
For the longest time I thought
no one would ever be my friend!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:45.210
That's why when Rat Man said
he'd be my first friend, I was so happy.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.090
So we started BiBiBi Fire.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.130
But I was still lonely...

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:55.260
Of course I was.
He was just tricking me after all.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:21:00.430
But then I met you,
and we talked every night.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.430
And we practiced together.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:05.350
I really had fun!

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:11.990
When I was with you,
I felt I wasn't alone anymore!

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:16.490
So please, don't go!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:21.370
If you go away, I'll be alone again...

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.840
I don't...

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.090
want to be alone...

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:33.090
either!

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:39.720
Practice was fun, wasn't it, Takuro-Bi?

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:42.020
Amefuri-Kozo!

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.360
I think they'll be able to
make it together.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:58.070
Their differences
let them help each other.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:01.450
Such bonds do exist...

